2275               
2276               /N IS A LINE OR GROUP NO. (CONVENIENTLY USE A VARIABLE
2277               /NAME WHICH IDENTIFIES THE FUNCTION!) AND THE ARG'S RE-
2278               /PLACE THE VALUE OF THE FIRST ENTRIES IN THE SYMBOL TABLE
2279               /BEGINNING WITH THE PROTECTED VARIABLE (#). THUS THE FIRST
2280               /THREE REPLACEABLE VARIABLES ARE #,$,%.  NOTE THAT ! AND "
2281               /ARE USED FOR SUBSCRIPTING.  FUNCTIONS REQUIRING MORE THAN
2282               /THREE ARGUMENTS WILL NEED TO DEFINE ADDITIONAL SYMBOLS AT
2283               /THE BEGINNING OF THE TABLE.  AS AN EXAMPLE:  Z;Z D1 D2 D3
2284               /SETS UP THREE ADDITIONAL "DUMMY" VARIABLES.  OF COURSE
2285               /THEY ARE PERFECTLY GOOD REGULAR VARIABLES TOO.
